# Local Plan Storage

- When creating a plan, store it in `./.cursor/plans/` for this repository.
- If the plan is initially created in the global Cursor plans directory, immediately recreate/copy it to `./.cursor/plans/` and continue using only the local copy.
- Mandatory verification after plan creation:
  - Confirm the plan file exists under `./.cursor/plans/` before any further work.
  - If the plan exists only in `~/.cursor/plans/`, treat it as a mismatch and fix it immediately.
  - Do not proceed until the local file is present and readable.
- Prefer filenames like `<topic>_<id>.plan.md` and keep plan files in version-control-friendly markdown.
